      "text": "if those whom elders bless live, they shall live unto the Lord, D&C 42:44 (124:86). live together in love, D&C 42:45. the Lord made all things which live, D&C 45:1. Saints shall come unto the Lord, and their souls shall live, D&C 45:46. they who enter Zion and live shall inherit earth, D&C 59:2. faithful who live when the Lord comes will be blessed, D&C 63:50. testimony that Christ lives, D&C 76:22. without greater priesthood no man can see God and live, D&C 84:22. live by every word that proceeds from mouth of God, D&C 84:44 (98:11). the Lord does not give unto Saints to live as world, D&C 95:13. I am he who liveth, D&C 110:4. Joseph Smith lived great and died great, D&C 135:3. dead hear gospel that they may live according to God in spirit, D&C 138:10, 34 (1 Pet. 4:6).",
